  <description promeva:title="Subtitle" promeva:type="3" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cyclone Mocha</narrative>
  </description>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the Myanmar cyclone Mocha JR is to provide 121.284  affected people with life-saving and life-sustaining humanitarian assistance.  The response is a multi-sector approach with a holistic intervention e.g., Shelter, WASH, Food Security and Livelihoods (FSL) and Multi-purpose cash interventions, with Protection being mainstreamed. Collaboration &amp; Learning between the partners (Oxfam, Plan, Save, Stg Vluchteling and Tearfund), Innovation, and Localisation are main themes in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
